# Optional. Leave unset to run the contact form in local-validation-only mode
# (it validates and shows an honest "not sent yet" message, no fake email).
#
# To actually send messages, point this at a form backend that accepts a
# JSON POST with { name, email, message } — e.g. a Formspree endpoint
# (https://formspree.io) or your own small API — then copy this file to
# .env and restart the dev server.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
